{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_04",
  "title": "我曾舍命为你",
  "storyCode": "HE-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b6d2f64eeeed323d98ba307d0f94a6a350f2347b0304fc8ee4b91686cb08f03b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火焰是会吞噬一切的魔鬼。\n再珍贵的物品，再受珍视的东西，只要一把火，一切都会就此消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "杰拉尔德曾和我说，他们萨卡兹没有故乡，只有如影随形的战火。但他希望他们能有一个故乡，因此他们愿意跟随一位了不起的大人物。\n只是后来他失望了，所以选择离开。\n那时我不敢问他为什么失望。\n刚来到这里时，我们曾经满怀希望。\n这些年生活虽然辛苦，大家却仍感到幸福。\n但是现在......现在。\n现在他们要离开了。我忍不住会想，是不是因为这里的生活也同样已经令他失望？\n我呢？我又如何？\n现在我正......我正看着那些我珍视的东西，在我眼前燃烧。\n燃烧。\n消失殆尽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "全都......没了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "好烫......！好大的火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "烧起来了！圣堂......圣堂烧起来了！快！快打水来救火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "怎么回事？我看到有火光，发生什么事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "莱蒙德！你怎么在这？你们不是，不是已经......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......现在不是说这个的时候！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "呃！对，对，你说得没错......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "你来得正好！圣堂着火了，快来帮忙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "圣堂？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "圣堂怎么会......怎么会忽然着火？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "我也想知道啊！往年这个季节也不是没有过火灾，但没一次烧得这么厉害，怎么偏偏就在这时候出岔子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "唉，总之得先把火灭了！幸好烧起来的不是大伙住的地方......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "先救火。等着，我去喊人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "水呢！咳......咳咳，还有没有水，再打点水来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "不行，这火势压不住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "你小心点，别吸这烟......我们得把大门关上，或许这样火就不会烧到外头来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "不行！你说什么混账话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "这可是圣堂！圣像还在里头！门关上，咳，门关上难道火就能熄了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "我不是这个意思！但现在太危险了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "正确的判断。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "啊？你懂什么......你是什么人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "这两个孩子是......不对，你、你怎么能让孩子留在这么危险的地方？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "快离远点！这里不安全！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "你说得对，这里并不安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "你已经吸入不少烟尘，如不立即采取相应防护措施，推测将很快出现头晕、重影等生理反应。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "那又怎么样？说了这么多，有没有点实际的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "我之前没见过你，你、你是萨科塔，你是拉特兰来的人吧！想点办法啊，那可是拉特兰的圣像！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "圣像并非我的任务中需要顾及的目标对象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "你在说什么......什么任务不任务的！现在是说这些的时候吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "你就不能用个什么，那种什么法术，把这该死的火给灭了？你要是根本什么都干不了，就站到一边去，别碍着我救火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......抱歉，我无法使用那样的源石技艺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "想要尽量减少损失，需要更多人参与灭火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "我这就去喊人来帮忙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "有人来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "你们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "来帮忙。莱蒙德通知了我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "少说废话，快点接一下水桶！我再去搬两桶来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "啊，好，好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "这里还有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "我来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "你们去安全的地方等待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "你是那个拉特兰的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "这两个小孩怎么回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "我不建议现在花时间讨论这个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "桶给你，抬稳了，小子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "克莱芒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "喂，别再往前走了，站住......克莱芒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "我不建议你现在进入火场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "放开、放开我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "在没有采取充足的防护措施的情况下，这样做会非常危险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "这个小哥说得对！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "你这是干什么？你不要命了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "我得去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "我得......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "......抱歉，我刚刚有点头晕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "......我知道出了这事最不好受的就是你，但你别发昏，这可不是闹着玩的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "你的那些花......花总能再种。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "水桶又要空了，我再去打点水来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "不能再往里走了！火太大，还有烟......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "你可以留下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "为避免烟雾中毒，建议你不要大声说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "我说话是为了谁？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "你不用跟着我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......我信不过你，我得盯着你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "不对，你听到什么声音没有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火焰熊熊燃烧，持铳的圣像发出不祥的嗡鸣。\n带着灼热温度的阴影投在莱蒙德身上，像是要审判这个竟敢走入萨科塔圣堂的萨卡兹，巨大的圣像在火海中倾倒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "后退！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刺耳的碎裂声在耳畔响起。预想中的疼痛并未造访。\n执行者挡在萨卡兹身前，紧握着铳的手臂抬起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "还有二次倒塌的风险，从这边走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "你的手臂......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "不，等等，你打碎了圣像？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "没有碎。如果不改变其倒下的方向，你会被砸中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "可这是你们的圣像......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "不重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "火势还在增大，这很奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "木制的长椅等内部陈设虽然易燃，但最初起火的位置有古怪，不能排除内部还有其他助燃物的可能性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "什么意思？你到底想说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "这是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（这里就是萨卡兹住的地方？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（......就靠这么薄的墙板，根本抵御不了荒原上的寒风。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（呼......真的有点冷呢。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（耽搁得太久，天都已经黑了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（嗯？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（那边楼顶的是......火光？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（这种时候着火......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（看来费德里科那边也出了不小的问题哦。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（......！有人来了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "他们都去修道院里帮忙了，我们要不要也过去看看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "斯特凡诺对我们很好，就算我们已经要走了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愠怒的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "要去你去，我才不去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愠怒的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "不是还有今天来的拉特兰人吗？让那些拉特兰人救他们去吧！我们没这个本事，就别去讨人嫌了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（哎呀，习惯性地躲起来了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（听起来像是闹矛盾了？我和奥伦刚到这里的时候，应该还不是这样的氛围......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "别太生气了，蕾拉她......她也不是有意要那么说的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愠怒的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "她不是故意的，那说明她心底里就这么想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愠怒的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "她怀疑我偷她的冬衣！我什么时候干过这种糟心事？往年这些都是由我负责，怎么之前她就没怀疑过？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "他们，唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愠怒的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "她就是觉得我们碍眼！他们都是那么想的！他们从没把我们当成一伙的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愠怒的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "斯特凡诺不同意撇下我们回拉特兰，他们就恨上我们了！我算是看清楚了，只有我们自作多情，那些人从没把我们当成一伙的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愠怒的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "杰拉尔德老大当初说要走，我还有点犹豫，现在看来就该这么办！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愠怒的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "走就走，谁怕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "但是......我们真的能走出这片荒野吗？探路的几个小伙子到现在都没回来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愠怒的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "那也比继续待着强。我怕要是再有下回，我就忍不住要揍人了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "（......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "......真冷啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "把自己关在房间里久了，都不知道外面的夜晚这么冷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "真是重大失职，薇尔丽芙恐怕要扣我的工资了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "唔，要是真被扣了，下下个月就不给莫斯提马买那个六层闪光水果蛋糕，自己做一个省省钱好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "没时间再耽搁了呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "——找到你了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "终于灭了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "东西基本都烧没了，不过还好，至少没烧到下面的屋子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "还好？哪里好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "圣像都烧成这样了，还有花圃......呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "人没事就是好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "喂，莱蒙德，你们那边还好吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "还行。死不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "你小子命硬，还真敢就这么往里冲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "看杰拉尔德回头知道了不揍你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......别告诉杰拉尔德老大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "现在知道怕了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "出了这么大的事，主教阁下怎么还没来，有人通知主教阁下了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "今天就先这样吧，也没其他办法，先通知主教阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "大家都当心点，别再出这样的意外......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "不是意外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔",
      "text": "大哥哥！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的居民",
      "text": "......你说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "这不是意外。初步推测有人蓄意纵火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "拉特兰的小子，这话可不能乱说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "不可能......谁会想烧圣堂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "喂，你这么说有什么根据？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "我说过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "火势不正常，有其他助燃物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......就这个？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "已经足够得出结论。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "你这家伙——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "等一下，莱蒙德。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "怎么？你也想说是有人故意放火？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "我......不确定。但是之前......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "之前我去喊人，这地方平常来的人不多，特别是、特别是你们萨卡兹更不怎么来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "但我却在附近碰到了你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的萨卡兹居民",
      "text": "等会，你这话是什么意思？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "费尔南，别打断！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "让他继续说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "我、我没别的意思。我就是想问问......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的居民",
      "text": "莱蒙德，你怎么会恰好出现在这？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "......这就是你想让我看的吗，杰拉尔德？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "你我在场，大家都有所顾忌，听不到多少真心话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "这就是我们的现状，斯特凡诺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "我明白，我一直都明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "我不是怪谁。谁都没错。大伙只是想好好过日子，安安稳稳的，只是现状如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "萨卡兹......注定漂泊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "......我说过，这里会是你们的家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "你是说过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "你也曾说，你想试着让那些孩子，在这里扎下你们的根。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "或许是我错了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "你说的，谁都没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "......斯特凡诺，你最近心事重重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "你在计划什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "text": "或者我该问，这场火......和你有关系吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
